Covariate Shift








Figure 42.14





\[
\color{gray}
\begin{aligned}
\hat\Delta_{\text{raw}}
&= \underset{\text{within-department summary}}{\sum_{x} \textcolor[RGB]{0,191,196}{P_{x\mid 1}} \ \left\{ * \right\}{\textcolor[RGB]{0,191,196}{\hat\mu(1,x)} - \textcolor[RGB]{248,118,109}{\hat\mu(0,x)}}}
